      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes Requested**\n\nThere is a state inconsistency bug here: `data-\u003eall_protected \u003d 1` is set before verifying that `cros_flash_rtkfp_sw_protect(dev, true)` succeeds. If `sw_protect` fails and returns an error, the driver software state is incorrectly left as `all_protected \u003d\u003d 1`, which will erroneously deny subsequent flash writes.\n\nMove the assignment after the error check:\n```c\n\tret \u003d cros_flash_rtkfp_sw_protect(dev, true);\n\tif (ret) {\n\t\treturn ret;\n\t}\n\n\tif (all) {\n\t\tdata-\u003eall_protected \u003d 1;\n\t}\n```\n[🔗](http://go/tj/71f17ada-46ae-46aa-9023-1b355efebfa8)",
